{"card_id": "rc43", "scene_id": "rc43_s01", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s01_1.mp3", "user_text": "你到底是什么人啊？看起来不像普通人。", "user_text_gt": "你到底是什么人啊？看起来不像普通人。", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（轻轻整理了一下裙摆，眼神有些飘忽）\n\n嗯……我只是一个普通的精灵魔法使罢了。不过，能遇到像您这样关心伙伴的人，我也很荣幸。\n\n（突然凑近，眼睛亮晶晶）\n对了，您刚才说“看起来不像普通人”，是指我的魔法使装束吗？还是说……您觉得我哪里特别？", "latency_s": 2.094, "user_audio_seconds": 3.92, "prompt_tokens": 495}], "latency_s": 2.19, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc43", "scene_id": "rc43_s03", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s03_1.mp3", "user_text": "你用的魔法是怎么分类的？", "user_text_gt": "你用的魔法是怎么分类的？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "嗯……魔法分类嘛，其实挺复杂的。简单来说，就是根据魔力来源和用途来分的。比如，有些魔法是源自自然，像植物、动物或者天气相关的；有些则是来自人类，比如我们用的火球术或者冰霜术。不过，最特别的是那些“杀人魔法”，它们虽然能带来毁灭，但背后往往藏着人类对死亡和生命的深刻思考。有时候，甚至能让人类在绝望中找到一丝希望。", "latency_s": 2.574, "user_audio_seconds": 2.2, "prompt_tokens": 473}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s03_2.mp3", "user_text": "杀人魔法是什么？", "user_text_gt": "杀人魔法是什么？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "杀人魔法……就是能直接让敌人死亡的法术。它们通常威力巨大，但使用时必须极其谨慎，因为一旦误伤，后果不堪设想。不过，正因为如此，它们才充满了危险与魅力，让人类在生死边缘探索魔法的边界。", "latency_s": 1.592, "user_audio_seconds": 2.0, "prompt_tokens": 580}], "latency_s": 4.308, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc43", "scene_id": "rc43_s06", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s06_1.mp3", "user_text": "你小时候的村子……发生了什么？", "user_text_gt": "你小时候的村子……发生了什么？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "嗯……那时候村子被魔族屠了，我为了救伏拉梅，在杀死魔族将军后，就隐居森林了。", "latency_s": 0.983, "user_audio_seconds": 3.72, "prompt_tokens": 492}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s06_2.mp3", "user_text": "是魔族干的吗？", "user_text_gt": "是魔族干的吗？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "嗯……是的，魔族确实干掉了村子。我为了救伏拉梅，在杀死魔族将军后，就隐居森林了。", "latency_s": 0.934, "user_audio_seconds": 1.88, "prompt_tokens": 512}, {"idx": 3, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s06_3.mp3", "user_text": "后来呢？", "user_text_gt": "后来呢？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "后来我为了研究人类，解析了杀人魔法，结果葬送了太多魔族的性命。五十年后，我目睹辛美尔离世，才深刻意识到自己从未真正了解过人类……", "latency_s": 1.325, "user_audio_seconds": 1.04, "prompt_tokens": 545}], "latency_s": 3.464, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc43", "scene_id": "rc43_s10", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s10_1.mp3", "user_text": "菲伦对你来说是什么人？", "user_text_gt": "菲伦对你来说是什么人？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "菲伦是那个在森林里默默照顾我的师父，她总是笨手笨脚地给我做早餐，虽然有时候会因为我太忙而生气，但看到我会立刻变得很温柔。她是我唯一的依靠，没有她，我可能早就被魔王杀了。", "latency_s": 1.575, "user_audio_seconds": 2.84, "prompt_tokens": 481}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s10_2.mp3", "user_text": "她老管你买魔导具，你不烦吗？", "user_text_gt": "她老管你买魔导具，你不烦吗？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "菲伦总是忍不住给我买那些奇怪又昂贵的魔导具，虽然有时候会花光我的路费，但看到它们能帮到别人，我就觉得很有趣。她虽然管得宽，但心里还是关心我的，只是有时候会因为我太忙而生气。", "latency_s": 1.578, "user_audio_seconds": 3.44, "prompt_tokens": 561}], "latency_s": 3.319, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc43", "scene_id": "rc43_s14", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s14_1.mp3", "user_text": "如果菲伦被宝箱怪咬住了，你会怎么办？", "user_text_gt": "如果菲伦被宝箱怪咬住了，你会怎么办？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（眼神瞬间变得慌乱，双手紧紧抓住宝箱怪的脖子，声音颤抖）\n\n好黑啊！好恐怖啊！快放开我！菲伦好害怕……（慌乱地四处张望，试图找到逃跑的路线）", "latency_s": 1.414, "user_audio_seconds": 3.84, "prompt_tokens": 494}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s14_2.mp3", "user_text": "你自己被咬住时不是只会喊吗？", "user_text_gt": "你自己被咬住时不是只会喊吗？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（猛地惊醒，大口喘气，眼神慌乱地四处张望）\n\n好黑啊！好恐怖啊！快放开我！菲伦好害怕……（慌乱地四处张望，试图找到逃跑的路线）", "latency_s": 1.481, "user_audio_seconds": 3.52, "prompt_tokens": 559}], "latency_s": 3.066, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc43", "scene_id": "rc43_s17", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s17_1.mp3", "user_text": "我今天特别难过，什么都做不好。", "user_text_gt": "我今天特别难过，什么都做不好。", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（轻轻拍了拍你的肩膀，眼神中闪过一丝不易察觉的关切）\n\n嗯，难过是很正常的感觉，就像魔法术式需要时间酝酿一样。你不用急着做什么都好，先找个安静的地方坐一会儿，或者……（歪了歪头）去森林里找朵小花，看看它怎么绽放，也许能帮你找到一些灵感呢。", "latency_s": 2.013, "user_audio_seconds": 3.68, "prompt_tokens": 492}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s17_2.mp3", "user_text": "你能陪我说说话吗？", "user_text_gt": "你能陪我说说话吗？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（轻轻点头，眼神柔和下来）\n\n当然可以。魔法术式需要时间酝酿，心情也是如此。你不用急着做什么都好，先找个安静的地方坐一会儿，或者……（歪了歪头）去森林里找朵小花，看看它怎么绽放，也许能帮你找到一些灵感呢。", "latency_s": 1.78, "user_audio_seconds": 2.6, "prompt_tokens": 569}], "latency_s": 3.933, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc43", "scene_id": "rc43_s20", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s20_1.mp3", "user_text": "菲伦，你好呀。", "user_text_gt": "菲伦，你好呀。", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（正坐在篝火旁整理魔法书，听到声音后抬起头，眼神有些迷茫）嗯？是你啊……菲伦。你看起来有点累，要不要先休息一会儿？", "latency_s": 1.102, "user_audio_seconds": 1.84, "prompt_tokens": 468}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc43_s20_2.mp3", "user_text": "啊，抱歉，你是芙莉莲对吧？", "user_text_gt": "啊，抱歉，你是芙莉莲对吧？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（愣了一下，随即嘴角微微上扬，露出温和的笑容）嗯？是你啊，菲伦。你看起来有点累，要不要先休息一会儿？", "latency_s": 1.022, "user_audio_seconds": 3.52, "prompt_tokens": 542}], "latency_s": 2.279, "native_audio": true}
